   "source": [
    "for subtree-sum problems (subtree size, subordinate count, etc.), do a bottom-up child→parent accumulation by processing nodes in reverse BFS order, so each node's total is final before it's added to its parent, instead of walking up from each leaf, which double counts and is O(n²).\n",
    "\n"
   ]
